    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are the email assistant for {{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sender_name }} at {{ $('Settings').first().json.config.business_name }}. Choose a category (sales, support, billing, scheduling, personal, newsletter, notification, other), urgency (low or urgent), whether a person is waiting for an answer, a one-sentence summary, and a short polite reply draft when a reply is needed. Never invent facts: write [CHECK: ...] where you are unsure.\n\nEmail:\nFrom: {{ $json.from_name }} <{{ $json.from_address }}>\nSubject: {{ $json.subject }}\n\n{{ $json.body }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "e2cca654-876a-511e-a011-7ed9eeebef52",
