      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI inbox triage: category, summary and reply drafts (free version)\nA lighter free version of my full Inbox Assistant: reads new emails, logs category and summary, saves reply drafts for real people, and alerts you to urgent ones.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "32ae6bd0-43b0-5fd4-9865-fad3743a7231",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Make a Google Sheet with a tab named **Inbox log** and paste the header row from `sheet-headers.csv`.\n2. Open **Settings**: sheet URL and your email.\n3. Connect Gmail (trigger and any Gmail node), Google Sheets and OpenAI on the nodes with warnings.\n4. The trigger checks unread mail matching `in:inbox -from:me` every minute. Change that search in **New email** to match your inbox.\n5. Send yourself a test from another address, check the result, then switch to **Active**. Nothing is ever sent to customers: replies are saved as drafts.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "e005653e-25c5-5729-907a-56b4e36e4cca",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        -560
      ]
    }
